'''Big Midsummer Plan!''' (Japanese: '''まなつのだいさくせん！''' ''Manatsu no dai sakusen!'') is an ending theme of one of the [[Pikachu short]]s, ''[[PK10|Pikachu's PikaBoo]]''.

